    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The last tank rolls in...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593430/extras/57fd4feb2053693e7a7cc9badc739a46.poster.avif?t=1750784973\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593430/extras/57fd4feb2053693e7a7cc9badc739a46.apng?t=1750784973\" class=\"bb_img\" width=96 height=144 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026 and it brought extra lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter <i>Golgalian</i>, the world's most powerful tank and last hope against the mech horde! Intense action, endless enemies, and scorching sands await in a mission that never gets easier. Dodge barrages of lasers and mortar fire, use the environment to your advantage, and melt steel with unprecedented firepower!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced shooting combat in a bullet hell for anyone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six unique power-ups for maximum shooting action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Constantly escalating difficulty in an endless level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of handcrafted, tactical enemy formations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global leaderboard for high score hunters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two biomes: Sand and Road!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The last tank rolls in...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593430/extras/57fd4feb2053693e7a7cc9badc739a46.poster.avif?t=1750784973\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593430/extras/57fd4feb2053693e7a7cc9badc739a46.apng?t=1750784973\" class=\"bb_img\" width=96 height=144 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026 and it brought extra lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter <i>Golgalian</i>, the world's most powerful tank and last hope against the mech horde! Intense action, endless enemies, and scorching sands await in a mission that never gets easier. Dodge barrages of lasers and mortar fire, use the environment to your advantage, and melt steel with unprecedented firepower!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced shooting combat in a bullet hell for anyone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six unique power-ups for maximum shooting action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Constantly escalating difficulty in an endless level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of handcrafted, tactical enemy formations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global leaderboard for high score hunters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two biomes: Sand and Road!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Pilot the tank Golgalian in an endless micro shoot 'em up inspired by arcades old and new. Blast mechs, dodge bullets, and compete on the global leaderboard!",
